        { q:"What did Moroni accuse Pahoran of doing?", choices:["Hoarding food","Trading with the Lamanites","Sitting in thoughtless stupor while thousands were slain","Hiding the sacred records"], a:2, why:"Moroni asked how Pahoran could sit on his throne in thoughtless stupor while enemies murdered thousands of his brethren." },
        { q:"What did Moroni threaten if the government did not act?", choices:["To resign his command","To surrender his armies","To burn the city of Zarahemla","To come against them and stir up insurrections until the wrongs were righted"], a:3, why:"Moroni vowed that unless they bestirred themselves, he would come against them in the strength of the Lord." }
